WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:03.770
-Last week, President Trump
invoked his emergency economic

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.305
powers to ban
the digital app TikTok.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:07.740
Here to talk about it
is our new writer, Jeff Wright.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.309
-What it do, Seth?
-Hey, Jeff.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:13.079
So what do you think about
the President banning TikTok?

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.115
-I hate this.
Someone has to do something.

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:19.419
-Oh, wow! So, I didn't realize
you'd be that upset.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.854
-Of course I'm upset!
I'm a young person.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:23.790
Imagine if someone
took your Metamucil, Seth.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.659
You'd be mad, too.
-I'm not that old.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:30.229
-Are you on TikTok?
-I'm on Twitter.

00:00:30.229 --> 00:00:31.830
-Oh, like the President.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.433
-I'm not as old
as the President.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:37.203
-Oh, good for you.
You sound like my grandma.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.438
That's a great attitude to have.

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:41.307
Look, like a lot
of young people,

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.243
I spend a lot of time on TikTok.

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.743
It's really important to me.

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.146
And I think this ban
is an attack on the youth.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:49.149
-Oh, interesting.
Why do you think ending

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:52.317
TikTok accounts
is an attack on the youth?

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:53.619
-Because that's something

00:00:53.619 --> 00:00:55.922
Donald Trump
has never had before.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:58.191
-A TikTok account?
-Youth.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.793
Trump has never been young
in his life.

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:02.195
The man was born old.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:04.497 line:0%
Look at this picture.
Look at that shirt.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.632 line:0%
He's 4 years old,
and he looks like he's headed

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:08.033 line:0%
to a parent/teacher conference.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.969
-Well, what about the fact
that the app can be used

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:12.104
by oppressive governments
and counterintelligence

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:14.507
to gather information
and surveil Americans?

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.943
-I don't understand
these old words you're using.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:19.144
Try saying "swag"
at the end of your sentence.

00:01:19.144 --> 00:01:21.947
-What about the fact
that the app could be used

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:25.151
to spy on Americans? Swag.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.387
-Ohh! That's what
you were trying to say?

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.189
Look, Seth, this is America.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.891
In 2020, we don't have
any intelligence.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:34.360
We're running around maskless,

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.529
coughing on each other
at Outback Steakhouse.

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.030
We dumb as hell.

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.633
The only information that could
be collected from our country

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.968
is what NOT to do.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:45.237
Besides, this isn't about
data or intelligence.

00:01:45.237 --> 00:01:48.074
This is about the President
getting roasted.

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:50.743
-Oh, so you think Trump's
decision to ban is based on

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.412
the amount of people
who make fun of him on TikTok?

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:57.617
-Seth, what is the only thing
worse than being teased?

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.252
-Being teased by people
younger than you

00:01:59.252 --> 00:02:02.488
on an app you don't understand.
-Exactly, Seth.

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:06.426
TikTok has been around and owned
by China for four years.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:08.561
But now suddenly
when Trump realizes

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:10.863
he's being roasted on it,
he has a problem with it?

00:02:10.863 --> 00:02:13.266
It's clear.
There's a connection.

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:15.735
It's like how I heard you wore
shorts to the office one time,

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:18.137
and everyone made fun
of your bird legs so bad,

00:02:18.137 --> 00:02:20.873
no one's allowed to wear shorts
to the office anymore.

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:22.909
-[ Stammers ]
That's not true.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:26.045
-So I can wear shorts
to the office?

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:28.914
-No one's going to the office
right now because of COVID.

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:30.783
-But I can wear shorts
when we come back?

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:34.620
-Well...I think it'll probably
be too cold for shorts then.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.023
-What if winter shorts
is my thing?

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.425
-Look, I don't have bird legs!
Okay?!

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:44.296
-See? You're mad that you
got teased. And so is Trump.

00:02:44.296 --> 00:02:45.731
I'd be mad, too, if an app

00:02:45.731 --> 00:02:48.100
that sounds like a fun way
to tell time

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.469
filled with people dancing

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.971
was actually being used
to make fun of me.

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:53.239
Old people are crazy sensitive.

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:56.575
Almost as sensitive
as they are indecisive.

00:02:56.575 --> 00:02:58.411
-Indecisive?
-Yes.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:00.179
First they tell us,
"Go outside more,"

00:03:00.179 --> 00:03:01.780
and, "Get off your screens."

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.216
Then you guys cancel outside
for what seems like forever.

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:06.152
So we stay inside
and use TikTok,

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.887
but now that's getting banned?

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:11.524
At this point, I'm like, "What
more do you want from me?!"

00:03:11.524 --> 00:03:12.958
Talk to 'em, Seth!

00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:15.761
Use your old words
to convince him.

00:03:15.761 --> 00:03:18.697
-I don't think I can convince
Trump to do anything.

00:03:18.697 --> 00:03:21.166
-What about when you convinced
him to run for president?

00:03:21.166 --> 00:03:23.236
-I, you know, I don't think
it was me who did that.

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:25.504
-You would think Trump
would love TikTok

00:03:25.504 --> 00:03:27.606
since he has so much in common
with it.

00:03:27.606 --> 00:03:30.276
They're both influenced
by shady foreign elements,

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.979
and they both make you
scream at your phone.

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:35.281
-What about the fact
that China may be using TikTok's

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:36.916
increasing influence
on young minds

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:39.084
to push communist propaganda?

00:03:39.084 --> 00:03:41.320
-I don't understand
these old words you're using.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.256
Try saying "swag"
at the end again.

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:44.923
-All right.
What about the fact that China

00:03:44.923 --> 00:03:48.427
may be using TikTok as a means
to push propaganda? Swag.

00:03:48.427 --> 00:03:50.963
-Oh! You got to lead
with "swag," Seth.

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:53.399
And so what if China's
pushing their narratives?

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:55.168
Food ads do it all the time.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.936
No matter how many times
they show me

00:03:56.936 --> 00:03:59.505
that cold-looking,
floppy-ass sandwich,

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:01.474
when I get hungry,
I'm never thinking,

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.475
"Hm. I should go to Arby's."

00:04:03.475 --> 00:04:05.645
-Sounds like you're really upset
about this.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:08.447
-Yes! TikTok was all I had.

00:04:08.447 --> 00:04:10.683
-You still have Facebook.

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:13.619
-Again, I don't understand
these old words.

00:04:13.619 --> 00:04:15.054
-Jeff Wright, everybody.

